00:45:05.639 --> 00:45:08.058
I don't know.

00:45:23.989 --> 00:45:27.648
Right back at you.

00:45:30.199 --> 00:45:32.548
So,crocotta,huh?

00:45:32.659 --> 00:45:33.989
Yep.

00:45:34.038 --> 00:45:35.938
That would explain the flies.

00:45:35.989 --> 00:45:38.128
Yeah,it would.

00:45:40.778 --> 00:45:43.389
Hey,um...

00:45:43.429 --> 00:45:46.038
look,I'm sorry it wasn't dad.

00:45:47.058 --> 00:45:48.969
I gave you a hell of
a time on this one.

00:45:49.778 --> 00:45:51.429
No,you were right.

00:45:51.478 --> 00:45:54.389
Forget about it.

00:45:54.429 --> 00:45:56.829
I can't.

00:45:57.918 --> 00:45:59.018
I wanted to believe so badly

00:45:59.058 --> 00:46:01.429
That there was a way out of this.

00:46:03.498 --> 00:46:06.739
I mean,I'm staring down
the barrel at this thing...

00:46:07.668 --> 00:46:09.949
you know,hell...

00:46:10.268 --> 00:46:13.849
for real,forever, and I'm just...

00:46:13.898 --> 00:46:16.268
yeah.

00:46:18.898 --> 00:46:21.639
I'm scared,Sam.

00:46:22.668 --> 00:46:25.949
<i>I'm really scared.</i>

00:46:25.989 --> 00:46:28.369
I know.

00:46:31.409 --> 00:46:34.248
Ess I was willing to
believe anything --

00:46:34.298 --> 00:46:36.579
You know,last act
of a desperate man.

00:46:36.619 --> 00:46:38.318
There's nothing wrong
with having hope,you know.

00:46:38.369 --> 00:46:40.898
Hope doesn't get you jack squat.

00:46:40.949 --> 00:46:43.159
I can't expect dad to show up

00:46:43.208 --> 00:46:45.478
With some miracle
at the last minute.

00:46:45.528 --> 00:46:48.179
I can't expect
anybody to, you know?

00:46:49.389 --> 00:46:53.108
And the only person that can
get me out of this thing is me.

00:46:56.389 --> 00:46:58.438
And me.

00:47:02.739 --> 00:47:04.929
"And me"?

00:47:04.969 --> 00:47:05.878
What?

00:47:05.929 --> 00:47:07.668
Deep revelation, having
a real moment here,

00:47:07.719 --> 00:47:11.208
That's what you come
back with -- "And me"?

00:47:11.558 --> 00:47:12.458
Want a poem?

00:47:12.509 --> 00:47:14.739
Moment's gme

00:47:16.418 --> 00:47:18.579
<i>Unbelievable. Roger smith...</i>

